Source: https://www.drupal.org/project/redis/issues/3337750
Preserve the existing non-zero output guard on Redis 1.11.
Upstream now normalizes INFO data and handles missing metrics, but isset()
still accepts zero and leaves the percentage calculation able to divide by zero.
Patch #24 and MR55 still target the old INFO structure and do not apply to 1.11.

